    "description": "Rejestr: P \u2013 przedsi\u0119biorc\u00f3w, S \u2013 stowarzysze\u0144 (P/S, wielko\u015b\u0107 liter bez znaczenia)",
    "maxLength": 1,
    "minLength": 1,
    "pattern": "^[pPsS]$",
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
